  "title": "Air Fryer Fish Sticks",
  "description": "Homemade fish sticks that are perfectly crisp on the outside and tender and flaky on the inside are easily made from scratch in the air fryer. Dip in tarter or cocktail sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
